{"a":[59,59],"h":"<p>Sûrei «Nûr» âyetleri «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"243\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 242.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 12.0 12.0 21.0 21.0 29.3 36.0 50.3 50.3 57.0 72.8 72.8 83.3 83.3 99.0 105.8 114.0 114.0 114.0 128.3 128.3 135.0 150.8 161.3 168.0 168.0 174.8 174.8 181.6 181.6 181.6 189.8 189.8 198.8 198.8 205.6 205.6 222.0 222.0 232.6 232.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"36.0 57.0 135.0 150.8\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ve « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"260\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 259.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 13.6 13.6 22.6 22.6 30.7 37.6 51.7 51.7 58.6 74.3 74.3 84.7 84.7 100.6 111.0 111.0 125.3 125.3 139.6 139.6 146.3 162.0 162.0 178.6 185.3 192.0 192.0 198.7 198.7 198.7 207.0 207.0 216.0 216.0 222.7 222.7 239.3 239.3 249.7 249.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 37.6 58.6 100.6 146.3 185.3\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » mü'minîn ve mü'minatın yekdiğerine göz belertmeyip nazarlarını kısarak edeb-ü ıffetlerini muhafaza etmeği öğreterek terbiyelerini yükseltmiş olduğu gibi burada da iymanlı hurr kadınların hiç bir vechile ezaya maruz kalmamalarını te'yiyd için buyuruluyor ki:</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"221\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 221.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 27.0 27.0 35.2 35.2 42.0 48.7 48.7 55.4 67.4 88.4 88.4 99.0 99.0 114.7 114.7 125.2 125.2 133.4 133.4 140.2 147.0 165.0 1